operations expected of this Dept it is respectfully suggested
that the War dept will not count up on these
garrisons for any thing ---- They are a dead
weight up on this Dept the Arkansas River now
promises to afford more facilities than it has during the
war & if it continues navigable we will endeavor to
throw a years supply of provision in to Fort
