1115 AM  Hd Qrs Army James Jany 25th
7 AM for Secy Navy . Sir your telegrams of op
730 PM & 10 P.M received . The force at the front 
is as follows , Onondaga , Mass =
= asoit , Hunchback , torpedo boat Spuyten =
Deyvil , launch number four and two tugs , Comm 
Morris at Turkey Bend , at Deep Bottom ,
" Daylight " at New Market Road , Miami at City Pt
, " Dawn " at Harrison Bar , and Genl Putnam
and " Com Barney " at the Appomattox river . We
attacked the Enemys gunboats yesterday and drove them back ,
two Iron clads and Howlett Battery . I shall proceed
to Hampton Roads tomorrow morning sig Wm A Parker
Cmdr Etc The Enemys gunboats all passed up at 3 AM

